LIMITATIONS
14	Geographic Specificity: Data from one region (Kirkuk, Iraq) may not generalize globally
15	Cross-Sectional Design: No longitudinal data to track severity changes over time
16	Parent-Report Bias: Relies on parent observations, which may be subjective
17	Age Range: Limited to children aged 2-16; not applicable to adults
18	Diagnostic Confirmation: Assumes accurate initial ASD diagnosis
19	Cultural Factors: Some behaviors may be interpreted differently across cultures



